FAQs
1.Is a degree needed? 
No, experience matters more.

2. How does this compare to an in-house role?
Managers are employees, consultants work independently across clients.

3. How long do engagements last? 
Weeks to months, depending on scope.

4. Can they run campaigns? 
Sometimes, but strategy is their core strength.

